Scope note / 适用范围

- The first copyright line covers the original code inherited from the
  upstream project (HanversionOvO/OHSidian), which ships per-file BSD
  3-Clause headers in ~290 .ets/.ts source files.
- The second copyright line credits HanversionOvO (display name MikannQAQ),
  the original author of OHsidian, whose upstream project this fork is
  based on.
- The third copyright line covers this fork's modifications and additions
  (PCFXPCFX/OHSidian).
- The bundled libelectron.so is a closed-source binary distributed by the
  upstream project under the same BSD 3-Clause statement.
- The bundled obsidian.asar is proprietary Obsidian software (declared
  UNLICENSED in its package.json) and is NOT covered by this license.
- Third-party components keep their own licenses; see the 许可协议 (License)
  section in README.md.

本文件第一行版权行覆盖继承自上游项目（HanversionOvO/OHSidian）的原始代码，
上游约 290 个 .ets/.ts 源文件带有文件级 BSD 3-Clause 声明；第二行署名
OHsidian 原创始人 HanversionOvO（昵称 MikannQAQ），本仓库即基于其上游项目；
第三行覆盖本 Fork 的修改与新增代码。内含的 libelectron.so 为上游分发的闭源二进制，同样
以 BSD 3-Clause 声明分发；obsidian.asar 为专有软件（其 package.json 声明为
UNLICENSED），不受本许可覆盖。第三方组件保留各自许可，见 README.md 的
“许可协议”一节。
